---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const KIT_URL = 'https://redefiningretirement.io/products/newsletter-ai-fast-track-kit';
---

<Layout
  title="The Newsletter Fast-Track Checklist | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Get your newsletter home base live in a few hours — the step-by-step checklist with Beehiiv-specific starter prompts, screenshots, and copy-paste steps."
  type="article"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">

      <!-- ── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <header class="article-header">
        <span class="tag">Free Checklist</span>
        <h1 class="article-title">The Newsletter Fast-Track Checklist</h1>
        <p class="article-deck">
          The 7-step plan to get your email list live and collecting — no tech overwhelm, no overthinking, no wasted hours.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- ── HELLO ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="hello-section">
        <img
          src="/images/corey-portrait.jpg"
          alt="Corey Koehler"
          class="hello-photo"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
        <div class="hello-text">
          <h2>Hello</h2>
          <p>Hey, I'm Corey Koehler (KOH-ler).</p>
          <p>Foundry worker, then mechanical draftsman for 17 years, then... whatever this is now.</p>
          <p>Years ago I had a blog pulling 10,000+ visitors a week from Google — and I never collected a single email. When the traffic dried up, I had nothing to show for it. The newsletter I built later, with the email list as the foundation from day one, is still paying me back today.</p>
          <p>This checklist is the shortcut version. Tick the boxes, lean on the prompts under each step, and you'll have your home base live in a few hours — not weeks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── THE HOOK ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="hook-block">
        <h2>Why newsletters crush YouTube &amp; social for long-term value</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Most creators think their subscriber count equals security. Reality check:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>👉 1,000 social media followers = about $79/month</li>
            <li>👉 1,000 YouTube subs = about $79/month</li>
            <li>👉 1,000 email subs = about $582/month</li>
          </ul>
          <p>That's not my opinion — it's from a Neil Patel study of 2,501 marketers, which found email subscribers generate 7.4x more revenue per month than YouTube subscribers.</p>
          <p>And the kicker? Email subscribers don't vanish when the algorithm decides to ghost you.</p>
          <p>Email subscribers = assets you own. Average lifetime value: $37.85 each (up to $100+ in high-value niches).</p>
          <p>YouTube subs = rented attention. They only pay if they keep watching, and you're at the mercy of RPMs, ad buyers, and YouTube's mood swings.</p>
          <p>A social media follower = even more rented attention — worth just pennies ($0.01–$0.10).</p>
          <p>Translation: 10,000 social followers might bring in a couple grand if you're lucky. 10,000 email subs? That could mean a far more reliable five-figure monthly income.</p>
          <p>That's the gap. It's why smart creators are finally saying:</p>
          <p><em>"I'll use YouTube and social for discovery, but my email list is my long-term plan."</em></p>
          <p>Here's the step almost every creator skips — the one that turns followers you're borrowing into something you actually own. Below is the fast-track version: seven steps, done in order, no fluff.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── PROMPT SETUP ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="setup-block">
        <p class="setup-title">⚡ Newsletter Mad Libs: fill in the blanks once</p>
        <p class="setup-text">
          Remember Mad Libs? Same idea. Type your niche here once and it drops into every AI prompt on this page automatically. Paste each prompt into the <strong>same chat</strong> as you go — every step builds on the one before it, so the AI keeps your context (your niche, your gift, your name) the whole way through.
        </p>
        <label class="setup-label" for="niche-input">Your niche or topic</label>
        <input
          id="niche-input"
          class="setup-input"
          type="text"
          placeholder="e.g., personal finance, fitness for busy parents, productivity"
          autocomplete="off"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- ── PROGRESS ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="progress-wrap">
        <div class="progress-label">
          <span>Your progress</span>
          <span id="progress-count">0 / 0 done</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track">
          <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── STEPS ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="steps">

        <!-- STEP 1 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Pick something worth trading an email for</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s1-1"><span>A "gift" is just something useful enough that a stranger hands over their email for it.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s1-2"><span>Don't overthink it — repurpose what you've already made: a "how-to" post/video that already did well, or the answer to the question you get asked all the time.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s1-3"><span>Or skip the gift for now — open a waitlist and figure it out later.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s1-4"><span>Fast idea list: checklist, quick guide/cheat sheet, tool/site/book list, mini case study, exclusive content, mini course/quiz, template.</span></label></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="prompt-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">⚡ Starter prompt — paste this into ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, or your favorite LLM, and keep using this same chat for every prompt on this page:</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
              <pre>Here's who I create for and what I've made before — give me 5 lead magnet ideas I could realistically finish in one afternoon.</pre>
            </div>
            <div class="kit-tease">
              <span class="kit-tease-icon">🔒</span>
              <p><strong>Longer version in the Kit:</strong> the full pick-your-gift walkthrough + the pro version of this prompt.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 2 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Decide what you'll send &amp; name it</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s2-1"><span>Who it's for (you probably already know — it's the people already watching/reading you).</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s2-2"><span>Your one-line promise: what they get every time you send.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s2-3"><span>Naming rule: clear beats clever, every time. "[Outcome] for [Audience]" beats anything cute a stranger won't understand in two seconds.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s2-4"><span>A simple name, picked.</span></label></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="prose">
              <p><em>Light helper, if it's useful: most newsletters fall into one lane — Analyst (data/trends), Curator (best-of roundup), Expert (teach your craft), Reporter (behind the scenes), or Storyteller (your journey). Pick the one closest to how you already talk to your audience.</em></p>
            </div>
            <div class="prompt-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">⚡ Starter prompt:</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
              <pre>Give me 10 simple newsletter name ideas for a newsletter about <span class="ph" data-ph="niche">[your niche]</span> for [audience].</pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 3 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Set up your email platform (Beehiiv)</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s3-1"><span>Create your free account (free up to 2,500 subscribers).</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s3-2"><span>Fill in the basics: publication name, description, and the "from" name people see.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s3-3"><span>👉 Beehiiv partner discount: 20% off your first 3 months with code GUIDE at signup.</span></label></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="inline-cta">
              <p>If you sign up through my link and use the code <strong class="coupon">GUIDE</strong>, you get 20% off your first three months.</p>
              <a
                href="https://www.beehiiv.com?via=GUIDE"
                class="btn"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                Start free on Beehiiv &rarr;
              </a>
              <p class="cta-note">Free plan available. Affiliate link — I earn a small commission at no cost to you.</p>
            </div>

            <figure class="screenshot-slot">
              <img
                src="/images/beehiiv-create.png"
                alt="Beehiiv's create a new publication screen"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.closest('figure').style.display='none'"
              />
              <figcaption>Beehiiv's "create a new publication" screen.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <div class="prose">
              <p><em>Why Beehiiv and not something else: I've tried the others. Free up to 2,500 subscribers, a built-in referral system, and analytics that actually make sense — that's why it's still what I use today. Pick it and move on to the next step.</em></p>
              <p><em>Tip: your "from" name should be YOU, not a brand they don't recognize yet.</em></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 4 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 4</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Build your signup page</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s4-1"><span>Headline + subhead (your promise).</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s4-2"><span>One clear button ("Join free").</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s4-3"><span>Keep it to one idea.</span></label></li>
            </ul>

            <figure class="screenshot-slot">
              <img
                src="/images/beehiiv-landing.png"
                alt="Beehiiv landing page and subscribe form builder"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.closest('figure').style.display='none'"
              />
              <figcaption>Website &rarr; landing page / subscribe form builder.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <div class="prompt-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">⚡ Starter prompt:</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
              <pre>Write a simple headline and subhead for my <span class="ph" data-ph="niche">[your niche]</span> newsletter.</pre>
            </div>
            <div class="kit-tease">
              <span class="kit-tease-icon">🔒</span>
              <p><strong>Pro version in the Kit:</strong> the fill-in-the-blank prompt that writes a high-converting page from <em>your</em> details + an exact template.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 5 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 5</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Write your welcome email</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s5-1"><span>Introduce yourself + set expectations (what they'll get, how often).</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s5-2"><span>Deliver the gift right away — no waiting.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s5-3"><span>Invite a reply — one simple question (helps deliverability and starts an actual relationship).</span></label></li>
            </ul>

            <figure class="screenshot-slot">
              <img
                src="/images/beehiiv-welcome.png"
                alt="Beehiiv automations welcome email editor"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.closest('figure').style.display='none'"
              />
              <figcaption>Automations &rarr; welcome email editor.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <div class="prompt-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">⚡ Starter prompt:</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
              <pre>Write a warm welcome email for my <span class="ph" data-ph="niche">[your niche]</span> newsletter.</pre>
            </div>
            <div class="kit-tease">
              <span class="kit-tease-icon">🔒</span>
              <p><strong>Pro version in the Kit:</strong> the full fill-in-the-blank welcome email script, subject line included.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 6 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 6</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Grab your signup link &amp; make it deployable</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s6-1"><span>Copy your shareable link / embed.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s6-2"><span>Test it on your phone — if it's clunky there, fix it now.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s6-3"><span>Have it ready to paste anywhere in 10 seconds.</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 7 -->
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">Step 7</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h2 class="step-title">Announce &amp; start collecting</h2>
            <ul class="checklist">
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s7-1"><span>Paste your link everywhere: YouTube description, bio, link-in-bio, pinned comment, email signature.</span></label></li>
              <li><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" data-id="s7-2"><span>Post one honest announcement — tell people what you're doing, why, and how to join. One post. Doesn't need to be clever, just clear.</span></label></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="prompt-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">⚡ Starter prompt:</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
              <pre>Write a post announcing my new newsletter.</pre>
            </div>
            <div class="kit-tease">
              <span class="kit-tease-icon">🔒</span>
              <p><strong>Pro version in the Kit:</strong> launch-post prompts + exact cold-outreach scripts tuned to pull your existing followers onto the list.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ── MILESTONE: LIVE & COLLECTING ─────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="milestone-block">
        <p>🎉 <strong>Your list is live and collecting.</strong> That's the whole game — a newsletter you actually own.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── MONETIZATION ASPIRATION (Block C) ─────────────────────── -->
      <div class="bonus-block">
        <p class="result-section-label">Looking ahead</p>
        <h2>What this unlocks later (something to aim for)</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>You don't need to think about money <em>yet</em> — right now the win is simply getting your list live. But it's worth knowing what you're building toward. Once you own a list, you've got options most creators never do:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mono-list">
          <div class="mono-item">
            <p class="mono-label">Affiliate income</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Recommend tools you already use (like Beehiiv).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mono-item">
            <p class="mono-label">Paid subscriptions</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Your best stuff, for your biggest fans.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mono-item">
            <p class="mono-label">Sponsorships</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Brands pay to reach an audience you own.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mono-item">
            <p class="mono-label">Your own products</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Courses, templates, digital downloads.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prose">
          <p style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">Get the list up first. The opportunities come to those who have one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── FINAL CTA: THE KIT ────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="cta-block final-cta">
        <div class="cta-card__label">What's next</div>
        <h2>Want each step done fast?</h2>
        <p>The <strong>Newsletter AI Fast-Track Kit</strong> hands you the pro fill-in-the-blank prompts, exact scripts, and short video walkthroughs for every step above — so you go from this checklist to a <strong>live, working email list today</strong>, without writing a word from scratch.</p>
        <a href={KIT_URL} class="btn">
          Get the Newsletter AI Fast-Track Kit &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>

  <style>
    .narrow { max-width: 720px; }

    .article-header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

    .article-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .article-deck {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 640px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* ── HELLO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .hello-section {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hello-photo {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      filter: grayscale(100%);
    }

    .hello-text h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .hello-text p {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .hello-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── HOOK ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .hook-block {
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hook-block h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .hook-block .prose p,
    .hook-block .prose ul { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
    .hook-block .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── PROMPT SETUP ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .setup-block {
      background: var(--text);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .setup-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .setup-text {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    }

    .setup-text strong { color: #fff; }

    .setup-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    }

    .setup-input {
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      outline: none;
    }

    .setup-input:focus { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(9, 161, 231, 0.15); }

    /* ── PROGRESS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .progress-wrap {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 5;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 0.85rem 0;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .progress-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .progress-track {
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0;
      background: var(--blue);
      transition: width 0.25s ease;
    }

    /* ── STEPS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .steps { margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; }

    .step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .step:first-child { padding-top: 0.5rem; }
    .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .step-num {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--blue);
      opacity: 0.5;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 5rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      padding-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .step-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

    .step-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .step-content .prose p { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
    .step-content .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .step-content .prose ul { margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    .step-content .prose li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .step-content .prose li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── CHECKLIST ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .checklist {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .check-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .check-item input {
      margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      accent-color: var(--blue);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .check-item span { transition: color 0.15s ease; }

    .check-item input:checked + span {
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-decoration: line-through;
    }

    /* ── PROMPT BLOCK (AI prompts) ───────────────────────────────────── */
    .prompt-block {
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .prompt-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .prompt-block pre {
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .ap-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .ap-head .prompt-label { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .copy-btn {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--blue);
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .copy-btn.copied { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-color: var(--blue); }

    .ph {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 600;
      background: rgba(9, 161, 231, 0.1);
      padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .prose blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--border);
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    }

    .prose blockquote p {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .prose blockquote p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── KIT TEASE (🔒 upsell hint) ───────────────────────────────── */
    .kit-tease {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
      background: rgba(9, 161, 231, 0.06);
      border: 1px dashed var(--blue);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .kit-tease-icon { font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

    .kit-tease p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .kit-tease p strong { color: var(--text); }

    /* ── INLINE CTA (Beehiiv affiliate) ────────────────────────────── */
    .inline-cta {
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    }

    .inline-cta p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .inline-cta p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0.85rem; }

    .inline-cta .btn { display: flex; margin: 0 auto; width: fit-content; }

    .coupon {
      background: rgba(9, 161, 231, 0.1);
      color: var(--blue);
      padding: 0.15em 0.45em;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .cta-note {
      font-size: 0.76rem !important;
      color: var(--text-light) !important;
    }

    /* ── SCREENSHOT SLOT ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .screenshot-slot {
      margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
    }

    .screenshot-slot img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }

    .screenshot-slot figcaption {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
      padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* ── MILESTONE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .milestone-block {
      margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .milestone-block p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── BONUS / MONETIZATION ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .bonus-block { margin: 3rem 0; }

    .bonus-block h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .bonus-block ul:not(.checklist) {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
    }

    .bonus-block > .prose > ul:not(.checklist) li {
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .result-section-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .mono-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .mono-item {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }

    .mono-label {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .mono-item ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .mono-item li {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* ── FINAL CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .final-cta .cta-card__label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--blue);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hook-block,
      .inline-cta,
      .final-cta { padding: 1.25rem; }

      .step { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .step-num { font-size: 0.95rem; width: auto; }

      .hello-section {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var KEY = 'newsletter-fast-track-checklist-v2';
      var boxes = Array.prototype.slice.call(
        document.querySelectorAll('.check-item input[type=checkbox]')
      );
      var saved = {};
      try { saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || '{}'); } catch (e) {}

      var fill = document.getElementById('progress-fill');
      var count = document.getElementById('progress-count');

      function update() {
        var done = 0;
        boxes.forEach(function (b) { if (b.checked) done++; });
        var pct = boxes.length ? Math.round((done / boxes.length) * 100) : 0;
        if (fill) fill.style.width = pct + '%';
        if (count) count.textContent = done + ' / ' + boxes.length + ' done';
      }

      boxes.forEach(function (b) {
        var id = b.getAttribute('data-id');
        if (saved[id]) b.checked = true;
        b.addEventListener('change', function () {
          saved[id] = b.checked;
          try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(saved)); } catch (e) {}
          update();
        });
      });

      update();

      /* ── Placeholder autofill (niche) ─────────────────────────────── */
      function bindPlaceholder(inputId, phName, storageKey, defaultText) {
        var input = document.getElementById(inputId);
        if (!input) return;
        var phs = Array.prototype.slice.call(
          document.querySelectorAll('.ph[data-ph="' + phName + '"]')
        );
        function apply(val) {
          var t = val && val.trim() ? val.trim() : defaultText;
          phs.forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = t; });
        }
        var savedVal = '';
        try { savedVal = localStorage.getItem(storageKey) || ''; } catch (e) {}
        if (savedVal) { input.value = savedVal; apply(savedVal); }
        input.addEventListener('input', function () {
          apply(input.value);
          try { localStorage.setItem(storageKey, input.value); } catch (e) {}
        });
      }
      bindPlaceholder('niche-input', 'niche', 'newsletter-fast-track-niche-v1', '[your niche]');

      /* ── Copy buttons ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      var copyBtns = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]'));
      copyBtns.forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var container = btn.closest('.script, .prompt-block') || btn.parentElement;
          var src = container ? container.querySelector('blockquote, pre') : null;
          if (!src) return;
          var text = src.textContent.trim();
          var done = function () {
            var orig = btn.textContent;
            btn.textContent = 'Copied!';
            btn.classList.add('copied');
            setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = orig; btn.classList.remove('copied'); }, 1600);
          };
          if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(done, done);
          } else {
            var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
            ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select();
            try { document.execCommand('copy'); } catch (e) {}
            document.body.removeChild(ta); done();
          }
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</Layout>
